y left)) (uuid fde418b4-4839-55d3-9170-2d983802940d)) (text "470pF is at the RHD pin; 10M bleeds the internal node. Switch capacitance/leakage/injection and shared reference mismatch remain modeled assumptions." (at 101.6 396.875 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid 1ffc98da-b19d-5ca5-93c7-5eab532df115)) (text "Fault threshold follows +/-5V rails and is far outside RHD +/-0.4V linear DC range. External low-voltage qualification is mandatory before unclamping." (at 101.6 404.495 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid b6daef4d-954c-544e-9837-42630af7afed)))
